          <figcaption id="trust-map-caption">Identity-based access enters the private boundary; services and storage are destinations, while DNS filtering and isolated testing remain controlled branches. The animated checkpoint is a conceptual audit sequence, not a literal packet trace.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

